# Scenario: ISO 23601 office escape plan with primary and alternative routes.
evacuation "Office Escape Plan" unit m
compliance iso
sheet a3 landscape
room office "Open Office" at 0,0 size 7x5
room corridor "Corridor" below office size 7x2
room stairE "East Stair" right-of corridor size 3x2
room stairW "West Stair" left-of corridor size 3x2
opening between office corridor at 50% width 1.2
door between corridor stairE at 50% width 1.1
door between corridor stairW at 50% width 1.1
here in office at 3.5,2.5 "YOU ARE HERE"
exit-final east in stairE at 2.8,1 side east "EXIT"
exit-final west in stairW at 0.2,1 side west "EXIT"
extinguisher f1 in corridor at 0.5,1 class "ABC"
assembly muster outside at 9,8 "ASSEMBLY POINT"
route primary here -> office -> corridor -> stairE -> east
route secondary here -> office -> corridor -> stairW -> west
legend auto
